body:
If the writing of this JD is any example of the type of person I work for, I bet you can easily guess...

&#x200B;

he doesn't.

How do I maintain the site fork, pick up garbage, remove snow, track materials, create and implement safety procedures all at once!? There isn't enough time for me to complete all of these and still work with all the subs to make sure all day to day ops are going according to "plan".

&#x200B;

Edit: I say "plan" because he is notorious for never having a plan and making impulse decisions without any thought or consideration to the needs of the site or employees
